<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Stakeholder Register: {{ project_product }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Stakeholder Register: {{ project_product }}</h1>
<h2>Register Table</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Role</th><th>comms_direction</th><th>decision_rights</th><th>Power</th><th>Interest</th><th>Attitude</th><th>Cadence</th><th>Channel</th><th>Owner</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Name]</td><td>[Title]</td><td>upward</td><td>Approve</td><td>High (cite: decision blocked/unblocked last quarter)</td><td>High</td><td>Supporter</td><td>biweekly 1:1 Wed</td><td>1:1 meeting</td><td>PM</td></tr><tr><td>[Name]</td><td>[Title]</td><td>lateral</td><td>Consult</td><td>Medium</td><td>High</td><td>Neutral</td><td>weekly sync Mon</td><td>Slack + meeting</td><td>EM</td></tr><tr><td>[Name]</td><td>[Title]</td><td>downward</td><td>Inform</td><td>Low</td><td>High</td><td>Supporter</td><td>weekly standup</td><td>Standup</td><td>PM</td></tr><tr><td>[Name]</td><td>[Title]</td><td>external</td><td>None</td><td>Low</td><td>Low</td><td>Unknown</td><td>monthly newsletter</td><td>Email</td><td>Marketing</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><strong>comms_direction:</strong> upward | lateral | downward | external <strong>decision_rights:</strong> Approve | Consult | Inform | None (RACI-style) <strong>Power:</strong> cite a recent decision this person blocked or unblocked — not their title</p>
<h2>Executive Sub-Register (refresh monthly)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Role</th><th>Current Attitude</th><th>Last Attitude</th><th>Changed</th><th>Why It Changed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ vp_c_level }}</td><td>[Title]</td><td>Neutral</td><td>Supporter</td><td>2026-03-01</td><td>Metrics dipped, no update from PM</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Resistor Log</h2>
<p>For each Resistor, write one sentence: what would change their mind? Revisit monthly.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Stakeholder</th><th>What Would Change Their Mind</th><th>Last Revisited</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Name]</td><td>[One sentence]</td><td>{{ date }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Management Chain (include skip-levels)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Person</th><th>Role</th><th>Relationship to PM</th><th>Decision Rights</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ manager }}</td><td>[Title]</td><td>Direct manager</td><td>Approve (on PM's scope)</td></tr><tr><td>{{ skip_level }}</td><td>[Title]</td><td>Manager's manager</td><td>Approve (strategic)</td></tr></tbody></table>
</body></html>
